              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komeeda ku gene yaga, yavugula iviju viosi vie Litembeli kandi naaviatanyia. Yahaana viliango vie Litembeli kandi naasingiriza uvwali vwa vanyasaye vageni mu vuli havundu ma Jerusalemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu vuli lidaala linene kandi vuli tudaala mu Ivuyuda, yumbaka havundu hukusigamira misambwa, ahi kimuli kidukanaa kisambirwi ku vanyasaye vandi. Munzira yiyi yeletera kuye mwene uvutima vululu vwa Yahova, Nyasaye wa vaguuga veve.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
