          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Ahazi yakuza kandi nateevwa mu Jerusalemi, navuzwa si mwaali mu vilindwa viu vwami mba. Muyaayi weve Hezekia yavugula ovogono vwivwe kuli mwami.",
          "type": "text",
